"                                y mejorando el flujo de operación desde la recepción hasta el empaque final."
msgstr "<strong>FERBA</strong> machinery is built to work inside high-performance fruit and vegetable lines, protecting the product at every stage and improving the flow of the operation from receiving through to final packing."

#. module: ferba_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ferba_website.pagina_maquinaria
