msgstr "Each machine can work on its own or as part of a complete postharvest line. At <strong>FERBA</strong> we design the flow around the product, the space available, the capacity required and the level of automation the customer wants."

#. module: ferba_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ferba_website.pagina_maquinaria
